# Studio app (`@pakfactory/studio`)

Follow [`apps/studio/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md), [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md) § Sanity guardrails, [`DESIGN.md`](../../../../DESIGN.md) when UI-adjacent Studio previews matter.

**Quick rules:**

- **Schemas in git only** — `defineType` / `defineField` / `defineArrayMember`.
- **SEO/Social:** `lib/seo-fields.ts` only; robots = `allowIndex` / `allowFollow` / `noImageIndex`.
- **ADR-014:** singular types/titles/desk labels.
- **Never** seed or write documents (humans only).
- **Blocks:** `schemas/blocks/` + register in `index.ts`.
- **Env:** `apps/studio/.env.local`; previews www **3003**, blog **3004**; `pnpm dev:studio` → **3333**.
